  description: "The user rises into the air and becomes invincible, allowing repositioning for up to 3 seconds. Use again to commit a landing, or land automatically when time expires. Deals damage and puts opposing Pokemon within the landing area to sleep for 1.2 seconds at touchdown. Protection lasts through the descent. Unite energy is spent once, at takeoff."
